<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have intensified border patrols and fired warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting a pause to unofficial trade. The Myanmar military has warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU, while the KNU has warned Thailand against supporting rival forces. Myanmar refugees are filling labor gaps as Cambodians return home, and Cambodia has made waiting villages permanent, while cross-border QR payments are being introduced in Bangkok's historic shopping districts. A 15‑year-old golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao, and a Thai opposition leader was targeted in a spyware attack. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOQXgyRVNpc3NWZ1U5ZTRoX01fbWhfSnQ2RmpMbVZITFNuaWZnaVBGcXFoUVlheXlzMjNwaFdvNUpzRml6VVA4YUdxc2J4TkRRMjhrS2t4WEZBektqZWJYQXNPa09tUGF5QUdGcWVHV3pDN0lrcF9QRE14WC1BeVVUMTBVa3lpNVc4YXFfc19MclBaRjMyc0NpdUg3T1dwbFFpR08zRHJoT3pnVDY5SEJjTGVTRW90M1Y3TjRPa0ItQ3B5SXJmRVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPYnBoQ1JxY2FZYXNVbXJmNnpWQllFMkZZcmtrZ21OWVRDOU1CVnZVeF9TclY4SjBtYTZub2djbmlBemlOS21QSVVTU3hjR19vMXBvd0h1LUF4UjQtM0NIUU5leVR1MDNxeWxtbUFQVVdSOFFpX2pXdHc4TDUxbUYzWjZJby1fMXl4ZkVRdV9JUDBnNHVlTWswbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi